OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBrisk winds. Rather cloudy with
OL,6,Fbest of limited brighter spells
OL,7,Fexpected during the morning. Some in
OL,8,Feast staying dry but occasional patchy
OL,9,Frain about, this focused in western
OL,10,Fareas of Central and Tayside.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FWindy and cloudy. Rain soon
OL,13,Fextending from the west across the
OL,14,Fwhole area during the evening, perhaps
OL,15,Fturning heavy at times and to snow
OL,16,Fover west hills.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
