OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FCloud, rain, hill snow
OL,6,Finitially, erratically clearing as
OL,7,Fsunshine and showers follow from the
OL,8,Fnorthwest through the day, with these
OL,9,Flater outbreaks focused over the west.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,12,FShowers occasionally reaching northern
OL,13,Fareas. Central Belt possibly seeing a
OL,14,Fband of rain and hill snow reaching
OL,15,Ffrom the south Tuesday. Otherwise
OL,16,Ffrosty starts, then dry with sunny
OL,17,Fspells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
